  "determination": true,
  "rationale": "Authoring resolves the optional shared authoring section into one named backend configuration without defining shared project authoring settings. The serialized structures store AWS profile/region and Ollama environment-variable references, while provider construction resolves credentials separately. Configuration and local HTTP CLI tests verify this path.",
